*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Local secrets -- wrangler reads .dev.vars for `wrangler dev`, and nothing
# here was ignoring it (or .env) before, so a stray `git add -A` would have
# committed a real GROQ_API_KEY/ADMIN_TOKEN straight to a public repo.
.dev.vars*
!.dev.vars.example
.env*
!.env.example
